# Styles / tokens

- Pipeline: `site.ts` branding → optional `design.ts` (`enabled: true` for dark/premium) → `branding.ts` CSS vars → `global.css`.
- Components use semantic classes / CSS variables — never palette neutrals that assume light theme.
- Contrast: body/muted text vs background must meet WCAG AA (4.5:1). During branding, compute with `src/utils/contrast.ts` — **do not run Lighthouse**. If a pair fails, stop and ask “Are you sure?” before writing. Details: `.cursor/rules/brand-contrast.mdc`.
- Self-host fonts; avoid Google Fonts CDN. Details: `docs/PLATFORM.md`.
